      "description": "展开侧栏的当前会话。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"会话\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" aria-current=\"page\">新对话</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{corner-shape:round;width:248px;padding:12px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--glass-surface,rgb(246 249 253 / 72%));box-shadow:var(--glass-shadow,0 3px 12px rgb(31 49 77 / 4%));backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(135%)}.ds-nav-item{corner-shape:var(--corner-shape,superellipse(1.3));width:100%;height:32px;padding:0 36px;border:0;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;background:var(--sidebar-accent,#e6e6e6);color:var(--sidebar-accent-foreground,#252a34);font:500 13px system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#4b7dc4);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Skill 条目",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "skill-entry",
      "description": "技能列表按容器 640px 切换单双列。条目最小 64px，图标 40px，沿用产品 xl / 2xl 圆角（14px / 18px）；13px 名称与 12px 说明单行截断，可用状态显示勾选，展开后查看完整说明、来源与路径。以下为示例内容。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-skill\"><summary class=\"ds-skill-summary\"><span class=\"ds-skill-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6m-8 0-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-skill-copy\"><span class=\"ds-skill-name\" title=\"code-example\">code-example</span><span class=\"ds-skill-description\">示例技能：构建与维护项目代码。</span></span><span class=\"ds-skill-status\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"可用\" title=\"可用\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></span></summary><div class=\"ds-skill-detail\"><p>示例技能：构建与维护项目代码。</p><p class=\"ds-skill-meta\">个人 · 本地安装</p><p class=\"ds-skill-meta\">.agents/skills/code-example/SKILL.md</p></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-skill{border-radius:var(--radius-2xl,18px);corner-shape:var(--corner-shape,superellipse(1.3));color:var(--foreground,#252a34);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-skill[open]{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted,#eef1f5) 50%,transparent)}.ds-skill-summary{box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:64px;padding:8px;border-radius:var(--radius-2xl,18px);corner-shape:var(--corner-shape,superellipse(1.3));list-style:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-skill-summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-skill-summary:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted,#eef1f5) 70%,transparent)}.ds-skill-summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ring,#4b7dc4) 50%,transparent)}.ds-skill-icon{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:var(--radius-xl,14px);corner-shape:var(--corner-shape,superellipse(1.3));background:light-dark(#f5f3ff,#2e1065);color:light-dark(#8b5cf6,#c4b5fd)}.ds-skill-copy{min-width:0;flex:1}.ds-skill-name,.ds-skill-description{display:block;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;line-height:20px}.ds-skill-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:500}.ds-skill-description{margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#616c7b)}.ds-skill-status{display:flex;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:4px;padding-right:4px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#616c7b);opacity:.65}.ds-skill-detail{padding:4px 12px 16px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-skill-detail p{margin:0 0 8px}.ds-skill-meta{color:var(--muted-foreground,#616c7b)}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-skill-detail{padding-left:60px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-skill-summary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "添加技能入口",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "skill-add",
      "description": "Skills 顶部的局部前景色胶囊入口，与搜索、刷新、设置并列；共享主要按钮及安装表单继续沿用蓝色。",
